WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:01,890
It's almost time for you to rest

2
00:00:02,490 --> 00:00:03,610
Just go back again

3
00:00:05,980 --> 00:00:07,220
I won't go back to the public office

4
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:11,790
What do you mean my legs are broken?

5
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:13,150
So what

6
00:00:13,470 --> 00:00:16,820
You plan to live like this for the rest of your life. What about you?

7
00:00:17,570 --> 00:00:18,850
You invited me over today

8
00:00:19,610 --> 00:00:23,020
Is it as a friend or

9
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:25,660
As a British prince

10
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:27,180
How could he be so invested in it?

11
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:29,180
The Sixth Prince of the British Government Team

12
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:30,940
And the prince is now in the limelight

13
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:32,940
Father asked me to test Shen Ting's tone

14
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:34,500
I thought I could hide everything

15
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:35,900
I still underestimated him after all.

16
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:38,180
In that case, the court is trying to test a friend who has been with him for many years.

17
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:39,620
I'm so ridiculous

18
00:00:41,180 --> 00:00:42,260
You don't take any side

19
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:45,260
What looks like two punches is actually

20
00:00:46,050 --> 00:00:47,250
Both sides are offended
